{{also|PLoP|plöp}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Imitative of the sound, or perhaps a variant of {{m|en|plap}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/plɒp/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-plop.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɒp|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|countable}} A sound or action like [[liquid]] hitting a hard surface, or an object falling into a body of water.
#: {{ux|en|He heard the '''plops''' of rain on the roof.}}
# {{lb|en|British|slang}} [[excrement|Excrement]].

====Translations====
{{trans-top|A sound or action like liquid hitting a hard surface}}
* Bulgarian: {{t+|bg|цопване|n}}, {{t|bg|плясване|n}}
